@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+<h2><!--n-->. Referral's pool listener, ready hook, milestone, referral-service and fraud-load catches keep logging when the thrown value is unreadable (KS-1868, referral, TIER 1)</h2>
+<table class="pmatrix"><tr><td class="pm-topic" rowspan="2"><strong>What this changes.</strong></td><td> Five held passes in <code>services/referral/src</code>: <code>db.ts</code> (the pg pool <code>'error'</code> listener and the <code>runDbReadyHook</code> catch), <code>services/milestoneService.ts</code> (three database read catches and the table-verify catch in one pass, two write catches in another), <code>services/referralService.ts</code> (four database read catches) and <code>services/fraudDetection.ts</code> (the load-from-database catch). Each passed <code>err.message</code> or <code>err?.message</code> into the log call; for a revoked Proxy or an Error whose <code>message</code> getter throws, that read threw inside the catch, so the call rejected instead of taking its fallback: <code>null</code> or an empty list for a read, a swallowed failure for a write, an empty start for the fraud load. Each read now sits in a try (<code>String(message)</code>, or the constant <code>unreadable thrown value</code>), so a hostile value takes the same fallback an ordinary Error already takes. <strong>This changes outcomes, not only log lines:</strong> a failed progress read returns the fresh default, and the milestone check then awards every milestone the user qualifies for as new CLAIMABLE rewards (6 of 6 in the recorder), and the fraud service starts with no counters.
+    </td></tr><tr><td>Forty-one new cells in five new test files: <code>ks1868-referral-db-pool-error-and-ready-hook-unreadable-throw.test.ts</code> (149 lines, 9 cells), <code>ks1868-milestone-service-db-read-catches-unreadable-throw.test.ts</code> (133 lines, 9), <code>ks1868-milestone-service-db-write-catches-unreadable-throw.test.ts</code> (111 lines, 6), <code>ks1868-referral-service-db-read-catches-unreadable-throw.test.ts</code> (146 lines, 12) and <code>ks1868-fraud-detection-load-from-db-catch-unreadable-throw.test.ts</code> (95 lines, 5). Cell ids <code>control ks1868 C1</code> onward and <code>RED ks1868 R1</code> onward in each. The product bytes are <code>db.ts</code> (+16/-2), <code>fraudDetection.ts</code> (+8/-1), <code>milestoneService.ts</code> (+42/-5) and <code>referralService.ts</code> (+32/-4). A scratch recorder (not committed) drove eight real entry points with the real winston logger and only <code>../db</code> replaced: at base a revoked Proxy and a throwing getter made seven of them reject; at head all seven take the ordinary-Error outcome; <code>generateCode</code> still rejects at head because it reaches two sites these passes do not touch.
+    </td></tr></table>
